graph TD
    A[Texto Longo] --> B[RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter]
    B --> C1[Documento 1]
    B --> C2[Documento 2]
    B --> Cn[Documento n]

    subgraph "Map Stage"
        C1 --> D1[Prompt Map] --> E1[LLM] --> F1[Resumo 1]
        C2 --> D2[Prompt Map] --> E2[LLM] --> F2[Resumo 2]
        Cn --> Dn[Prompt Map] --> En[LLM] --> Fn[Resumo n]
    end

    F1 --> G[Reduce Stage: Combinar Resumos]
    F2 --> G
    Fn --> G

    G --> H[Prompt Reduce]
    H --> I[LLM]
    I --> J[Resumo Final]
